Help For Region

Choose the region for the radio's location: 1 Europe, Africa, Middle East and northern Asia; 2 Americas; 3 other Asia and Pacific. Default: 1. Entry reads the setting; r cycles 1, 2, 3 and saves immediately. h repeats help; q finishes with Done and returns to Settings. Regional limits do not replace national rules or unlock the radio. YAC refuses automatic transmission outside its supported amateur ranges.

